ring straw.\"","nextNodeIds":[711080303]},{"nodeId":711080303,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":2000509794,"text":"\"Tying straw. Exhausting.\"","nextNodeIds":[711080304]},{"nodeId":711080304,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":1700244650,"text":"\"...Practicing the Light Piercer technique. Destroyed all the dummies by mistake... I might as well train with the sword first.\"","nextNodeIds":[711080305,711080306]},{"nodeId":711080305,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":925242082,"text":"Continue reading.","nextNodeIds":[711080307]},{"nodeId":711080307,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":2508005098,"text":"\"...Bored. As I sat before the courtyard, I felt slightly hungry... I pondered on what I saw the other day, and I suddenly felt enlightened. If I use the sword... (indiscernible) I'll call it Rain Cutter. I'll try it another day.\"","nextNodeIds":[711080308]},{"nodeId":711080308,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":2650166554,"text":"\"...I accidentally fell while practicing Rain Cutter. Luckily, it's nothing serious... I thought of an idea. Why not dig a deep pond below the piles? Not only will it prevent injuries from falls, but I can raise fish for food...\"","nextNodeIds":[711080309]},{"nodeId":711080309,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":3276186538,"text":"\"...I went to a fisherman and bought dozens of fish... I tried cooking them. Their deliciousness was unrivaled...\"","nextNodeIds":[711080310]},{"nodeId":711080310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":3645814714,"text":"(The next ten or so pages are dedicated to detailed records of cooking methods for fish, and some are even paired with illustrations.)","nextNodeIds":[711080311]},{"nodeId":711080311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":688548338,"text":"\"...Accidentally fell while practicing Rain Cutter.\"","nextNodeIds":[711080312]},{"nodeId":711080312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":3836081226,"text":"\"...Success.\"","nextNodeIds":[711080313,711080314]},{"nodeId":711080313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3869607410,"text":"Continue reading.","nextNodeIds":[711080315]},{"nodeId":711080315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":3354242514,"text":"\"...The spear and sword must be wielded with the same mastery as... (Indiscernible. There is a comment from the 3rd Master beside it: second nature.) ... And that, is the truth... Yet there is none... How shall it be granted? How shall it be revealed?\"","nextNodeIds":[711080316]},{"nodeId":711080316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":1254930266,"text":"\"...Renovate the library. Design... within, and...\"","nextNodeIds":[711080317]},{"nodeId":711080317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":3514477978,"text":"\"...Look with the <color=#00E1FFFF>eyes</color>, and combine <color=#00E1FFFF>scrolls of knowledge from all places</color> with <color=#00E1FFFF>chambers of all corners</color>, then...\"","nextNodeIds":[711080318]},{"nodeId":711080318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":2230,"speakerName":"\"Guhua Notes\"","textMapHash":1189450362,"text":"(The next few pages are smudged and unintelligible. There is a comment from the 3rd Master at the side: This advises future generations to read extensively.)","nextNodeIds":[711080319,711080320]},{"nodeId":711080319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMap